  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">After school - Learning centres for slum Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BASS India operate  3 After-School Transformational Learning centres for the slum children in Guntur. These slums are situated far from city and where no educational facilities are available. Most of the children&apos;s families are living in poverty and are not able to send their children too far to private educational institutions. This project  provides quality primary education to enhance children&apos;s ability, confidence, learning levels and skills  and also makes a part of local formal schools.</narrative>
  </description>
